{"5348770":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Woolwater","steam_appid":5348770,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Woolwater<\/strong> is a calm puzzle game about sheep, fences and water. Each meadow gives you only a few fences. Find where to place them so your sheep have a roomy pasture with no way out.<\/p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5348770\/extras\/438b82886ed180e7055418c1092701f8.poster.avif?t=1793702098\" width=1170 height=164 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5348770\/extras\/438b82886ed180e7055418c1092701f8.webm?t=1793702098\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5348770\/extras\/438b82886ed180e7055418c1092701f8.mp4?t=1793702098\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Water has its own plans<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Water helps keep sheep in, too. Place a fence across a stream and part of the channel may dry out. That can give your sheep more ground — and a new way out.<\/p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5348770\/extras\/37f212d8f22cee8f4102769f879af7c4.poster.avif?t=1793702098\" width=1170 height=164 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5348770\/extras\/37f212d8f22cee8f4102769f879af7c4.webm?t=1793702098\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5348770\/extras\/37f212d8f22cee8f4102769f879af7c4.mp4?t=1793702098\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Bridges, sluice gates, portals<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bridges let sheep cross water, sluice gates send it down another channel, and portals connect distant parts of the meadow — sometimes opening a way out where you didn’t expect one.<\/p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5348770\/extras\/c37aba538ef396b4f7be81647a353ed6.poster.avif?t=1793702098\" width=1170 height=164 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5348770\/extras\/c37aba538ef396b4f7be81647a353ed6.webm?t=1793702098\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5348770\/extras\/c37aba538ef396b4f7be81647a353ed6.mp4?t=1793702098\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Together or apart<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some meadows ask you to keep the white and brown sheep together; others need them apart. On some, the same fence layout has to work at both low and high water.<\/p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5348770\/extras\/bf31cb228c8e34af8bd5c0eafc7a9b2a.poster.avif?t=1793702098\" width=1170 height=164 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5348770\/extras\/bf31cb228c8e34af8bd5c0eafc7a9b2a.webm?t=1793702098\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5348770\/extras\/bf31cb228c8e34af8bd5c0eafc7a9b2a.mp4?t=1793702098\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Clover yes, bees no<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A roomy pasture, clover and golden apples help your score; bees bring it down. Reach the target to move on, or keep trying for the maximum. You can undo your moves and take your time. There’s no timer.<\/p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5348770\/extras\/24bae5e8e17128945a2450f13a0f1fe4.poster.avif?t=1793702098\" width=1170 height=164 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5348770\/extras\/24bae5e8e17128945a2450f13a0f1fe4.webm?t=1793702098\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5348770\/extras\/24bae5e8e17128945a2450f13a0f1fe4.mp4?t=1793702098\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Create your own maps<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Draw a map from scratch or start with a random one. Share your maps on Steam Workshop and try maps made by other players.<\/p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5348770\/extras\/13ac8c8d533ab31791c5b25c3271649c.poster.avif?t=1793702098\" width=1170 height=164 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5348770\/extras\/13ac8c8d533ab31791c5b25c3271649c.webm?t=1793702098\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5348770\/extras\/13ac8c8d533ab31791c5b25c3271649c.mp4?t=1793702098\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5348770\/extras\/f991cd100d03d6a32c02305212a0b082.poster.avif?t=1793702098\" width=1170 height=164 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5348770\/extras\/f991cd100d03d6a32c02305212a0b082.webm?t=1793702098\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5348770\/extras\/f991cd100d03d6a32c02305212a0b082.mp4?t=1793702098\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><br>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Woolwater<\/strong> is a calm puzzle game about sheep, fences and water. Each meadow gives you only a few fences. Find where to place them so your sheep have a roomy pasture with no way out.<\/p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5348770\/extras\/438b82886ed180e7055418c1092701f8.poster.avif?t=1793702098\" width=1170 height=164 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5348770\/extras\/438b82886ed180e7055418c1092701f8.webm?t=1793702098\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5348770\/extras\/438b82886ed180e7055418c1092701f8.mp4?t=1793702098\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Water has its own plans<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Water helps keep sheep in, too. Place a fence across a stream and part of the channel may dry out. That can give your sheep more ground — and a new way out.<\/p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5348770\/extras\/37f212d8f22cee8f4102769f879af7c4.poster.avif?t=1793702098\" width=1170 height=164 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5348770\/extras\/37f212d8f22cee8f4102769f879af7c4.webm?t=1793702098\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5348770\/extras\/37f212d8f22cee8f4102769f879af7c4.mp4?t=1793702098\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Bridges, sluice gates, portals<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bridges let sheep cross water, sluice gates send it down another channel, and portals connect distant parts of the meadow — sometimes opening a way out where you didn’t expect one.<\/p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5348770\/extras\/c37aba538ef396b4f7be81647a353ed6.poster.avif?t=1793702098\" width=1170 height=164 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5348770\/extras\/c37aba538ef396b4f7be81647a353ed6.webm?t=1793702098\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5348770\/extras\/c37aba538ef396b4f7be81647a353ed6.mp4?t=1793702098\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Together or apart<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some meadows ask you to keep the white and brown sheep together; others need them apart. On some, the same fence layout has to work at both low and high water.<\/p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5348770\/extras\/bf31cb228c8e34af8bd5c0eafc7a9b2a.poster.avif?t=1793702098\" width=1170 height=164 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5348770\/extras\/bf31cb228c8e34af8bd5c0eafc7a9b2a.webm?t=1793702098\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5348770\/extras\/bf31cb228c8e34af8bd5c0eafc7a9b2a.mp4?t=1793702098\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Clover yes, bees no<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A roomy pasture, clover and golden apples help your score; bees bring it down. Reach the target to move on, or keep trying for the maximum. You can undo your moves and take your time. There’s no timer.<\/p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5348770\/extras\/24bae5e8e17128945a2450f13a0f1fe4.poster.avif?t=1793702098\" width=1170 height=164 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5348770\/extras\/24bae5e8e17128945a2450f13a0f1fe4.webm?t=1793702098\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5348770\/extras\/24bae5e8e17128945a2450f13a0f1fe4.mp4?t=1793702098\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Create your own maps<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Draw a map from scratch or start with a random one. Share your maps on Steam Workshop and try maps made by other players.<\/p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5348770\/extras\/13ac8c8d533ab31791c5b25c3271649c.poster.avif?t=1793702098\" width=1170 height=164 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5348770\/extras\/13ac8c8d533ab31791c5b25c3271649c.webm?t=1793702098\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5348770\/extras\/13ac8c8d533ab31791c5b25c3271649c.mp4?t=1793702098\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5348770\/extras\/f991cd100d03d6a32c02305212a0b082.poster.avif?t=1793702098\" width=1170 height=164 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5348770\/extras\/f991cd100d03d6a32c02305212a0b082.webm?t=1793702098\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><s